    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537606/research-assistant-professor-in-the-department-of-geography": {
      "title": "Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Geography",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Faculty of Social Sciences 1 Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Geography The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537606 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Geography (30900) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow Hong Kong Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Geography (Ref.: 537606) We invite applications from highly motivated and accomplished researchers for a Research Assistant Professorship in the Department of Geography. This position is ideal for researchers who aim to develop an independent research programme at the intersection of Geospatial Artificial Intelligence, Remote Sensing, and Geospatial Data Science. The successful candidate will contribute to the development of intelligent models that learn from large-scale and heterogeneous geospatial data and support scientific discovery and real-world applications. We now invite applications for the captioned post(s). Duties and Responsibilities Develop deep learning methods for complex geospatial and environmental problems. Develop geospatial foundation models using large-scale and heterogeneous geospatial data, including satellite imagery, multi-sensor time series, geographic datasets, and global land-surface products. Design deep learning and multimodal models for long-term, multi-source remote sensing time series. Incorporate geographical knowledge, physical principles, and process-based constraints into deep learning models. Explore foundation models and deep learning for interdisciplinary applications in agriculture, environmental monitoring, disaster monitoring, and sustainable development. Lead independent research projects and supervise postgraduate students. Develop collaborations across geography, computer science, environmental science, and related disciplines. Secure external research funding. Publish original research articles in leading journals. Requirements A Ph.D. in Geography, Remote Sensing, Geoinformatics, Computer Science, or a related field. At least two years of postdoctoral or equivalent research experience, with a strong record of peer-reviewed publications. Strong programming and computational skills in Python and deep learning frameworks such as PyTorch or TensorFlow. Experience working with large-scale geospatial or environmental datasets. Experience with deep learning methods for geospatial applications, including Transformer architectures, geospatial foundation models, self-supervised learning, and multitask learning. A strong interest in interdisciplinary research and the ability to connect methodological innovation with real-world geospatial and environmental applications. Proven ability to work independently and collaboratively. What We Offer The appointment will commence as soon as possible on a temporary basis for 1 year, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered. Other benefits include annual leave, medical benefits and free access to on-campus gyms and libraries. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above post(s). Applicants should apply online at the University’s careers site (https://jobs.hku.hk) and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 31, 2026, or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency. Advertised: Oct 9, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537606 Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Geography Department of Geography (30900) Oct 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537606 Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Geography Department of Geography (30900) Oct 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
    },
    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537607/全職辦公室服務員": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories General Support Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Business and Economics 1 全職辦公室服務員 The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537607 Work type: Full-time Department: Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Categories: General Support Staff Hong Kong 香港大學 經濟及工商管理學院聘請: 全職辦公室服務員 (檔案編號：537607) (須盡早到任；以一年臨時合約形式聘用；若工作表現滿意，可獲續聘) 應徵者須具備中三或以上程度學歷，能操流利粵語，略懂英語及普通話；能閱讀及書寫簡單中、英文更佳。受聘者須主動積極、守時盡責及具獨立處理事務能力。具相關經驗者將獲優先考慮。 受聘者須負責執行一般雜務，包括執行外勤及文件派遞、清潔打掃辦公室及學院所屬的地方、處理體力工作（如搬運物品、設備等）、準備會議及茶水，並執行由上級指派的其他工作 。每週工作不少於四十四小時。 入職薪酬將按受聘者之學歷及有關工作經驗釐定。僱員福利包括有薪假期及醫療福利。 大學只接受透過網上系統遞交的申請。應徵者請到大學人才招聘網站( https://jobs.hku.hk ) 遞交網上申請及上載最新的個人履歷。遴選程序將盡快開始，至 2026年10月29日 ，或直至空缺填補，以較早者為準。 港大徵聘   公開公平 Advertised: Oct 9, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537607 全職辦公室服務員 Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 29, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537607 全職辦公室服務員 Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 29, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
