    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537608/executive-assistant-undergraduate-admissions-at-the-rank-of-clerk-ii": {
      "title": "Executive Assistant, Undergraduate Admissions (at the rank of Clerk II)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Business and Economics 1 Executive Assistant, Undergraduate Admissions (at the rank of Clerk II) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537608 Work type: Full-time Department: Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Assistant, Undergraduate Admissions (at the rank of Clerk II) in the Faculty of Business and Economics (Ref.: 537608) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis, with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good bachelor’s degree with at least 1 year of work experience.  They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (preferably with fluency in Putonghua); good interpersonal, communication and organisational skills; computer literacy; and the ability to work independently and multitask under pressure.  They should also be detail-oriented and self-motivated with a strong sense of responsibility.  Experience in handling recruitment and student admissions matters would be an advantage.  Fresh graduates with a good academic background will also be considered. The appointee will provide administrative support to recruitment and student admissions for the Faculty’s undergraduate programmes, including providing information to prospective candidates, handling and processing applications and admissions offers, arranging interviews and assisting in all marketing efforts such as admissions talks and events.  He/She will also undertake other duties as assigned. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until October 29, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 9, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537608 Executive Assistant, Undergraduate Admissions (at the rank of Clerk II) Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 29, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537608 Executive Assistant, Undergraduate Admissions (at the rank of Clerk II) Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 29, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
