ovember 6, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 7, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 6, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537574 Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) in the Division of Nephrology Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Nov 6, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537574 Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) in the Division of Nephrology Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Nov 6, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
