    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537578/executive-officer-in-the-graduate-school-of-the-research-services-of-the-registry": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Executive Officer in the Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537578 Work type: Full-time Department: Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry (60341) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Officer in the Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry (Ref.: 537578) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should have a good university degree with at least 3 years’ solid administrative work experience, preferably in tertiary institutions.  They should have an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua); good computer literacy, communication and interpersonal skills; high level of organisational and problem-solving skills; a strong sense of responsibility; and the ability to work independently and under pressure.  They should be good team players with the ability to multitask and be attentive to details. The appointee will be responsible for administering the research postgraduate (RPg) programmes including admissions, coursework, progress monitoring and thesis examinations, take part in new projects/initiatives, coordinate general office administrative duties, and perform any other duties as assigned.  Training and/or previous work experience in system development will be an advantage.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview.  Information about the Graduate School can be obtained at http://gradsch.hku.hk . A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of application will commence as soon as possible and continue until October 27, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 7, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 27, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537578 Executive Officer in the Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry (60341) Oct 27, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537578 Executive Officer in the Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry Graduate School of the Research Services of the Registry (60341) Oct 27, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
