    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537425/tenuretrack-clinical-professorclinical-associate-professorclinical-assistant-professor": {
      "title": "Tenure-Track Clinical Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professoriate Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Tenure-Track Clinical Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537425 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Anaesthesiology, School of Clinical Medicine (20100) Categories: Professoriate Staff Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointments as Tenure-Track Clinical Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts) in the Department of Anaesthesiology, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537425), to commence as soon as possible, on a four-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and consideration for tenure before the expiry of a second four-year fixed-term contract. Applicants should possess a medical qualification registrable with the Medical Council of Hong Kong, with the attainment of the status as Fellow of the Hong Kong Academy of Medicine or equivalent.  Those with a higher academic qualification (e.g. MD, MS, PhD) would be preferred.  Applicants for the post of Clinical Professor should have a distinguished and sustained record of high-quality impactful research, as indicated by publications and competitive grants, with demonstrated clinical excellence in anaesthesia and/or pain medicine.  They should have also achieved international recognition for scholarship and professional expertise; and be able to demonstrate a strong commitment to, and evidence of, excellence in teaching, curriculum development, capacity building, mentoring early career researchers and supervision at both undergraduate and postgraduate levels.  Applicants for the post of Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor should display strong research track record, clinical skills in anaesthesia and/or pain medicine, and experience in teaching.  Proven capacity to initiate and contribute to basic, clinical and/or translational research is essential. The appointees will focus on the education of medical students, postgraduate teaching and supervision, as well as academic research.  They may be assigned to discharge duties at hospital(s) and clinic(s) affiliated with HKU Health System. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits.  At current rates, salaries tax does not exceed 15% of gross income.  The appointments will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary.  A monthly cash allowance will be offered to the successful candidates.  Housing benefits will also be provided as applicable. The University only accepts online application for the above posts.  Applicants should apply online at the University’s career site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) with (i) an executive summary outlining their most outstanding accomplishments and qualifications; (ii) an up-to-date C.V. together with a publication list highlighting their best publications in recent years; (iii) contact information of at least 3 referees; and (iv) a 1-page description of their future research and career plan.  Review of applications will start from December 5, 2026 and continue until 31 January, 2027 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Jan 31, 2027 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537425 Tenure-Track Clinical Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor Department of Anaesthesiology, School of Clinical Medicine (20100) Jan 31, 2027 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537425 Tenure-Track Clinical Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Assistant Professor Department of Anaesthesiology, School of Clinical Medicine (20100) Jan 31, 2027 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
