    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537559/nurse": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Nurse The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537559 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Nurse in the Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537559) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis or one-year temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should be registered with the Nursing Council of Hong Kong, preferably with clinical experience in ophthalmic care.  They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including fluent Cantonese).  They should be well-organized, responsible, self-motivated, with the ability to multi-task and work independently as well as collaboratively as a team. The appointee will assist in clinical services in the Department, primarily working at the HKU Eye Centre.  He/She will provide nursing care support during ophthalmic consultations, ocular procedures and surgeries, clinical trials, and will also be responsible for health education and other duties as assigned.  Occasional overtime work may be required. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits.  The appointment on fixed-term basis will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from October 19, 2026 and continue until November 2, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 2, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537559 Nurse Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Nov 2, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537559 Nurse Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Nov 2, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
