      "title": "Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Engineering 1 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537464 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) in the Department of Mechanical Engineering (Ref.: 537464) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should possess a Bachelor's degree with at least 5 years’ relevant work experience, preferably in taught-postgraduate programme administration experience within a tertiary institution. They should be effective communicators with the ability to work independently. An excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua and Cantonese), a high level of interpersonal, organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills, as well as a good level of IT proficiency are essential. Applicants should also be good team players, fast learners, and capable of managing multiple tasks under tight deadlines. High attention to detail, accuracy, maturity, and leadership ability are expected. The appointee will oversee and administer the management work in relation to Taught Postgraduate Programme administration and its financial management. He/She will handle daily office operations, support administrative tasks related to TPg programmes, and undertake ad-hoc or non-routine tasks as needed. Leading and supervising a small team of staff to deliver high-quality service is expected. The appointee will also be required to perform other duties as assigned, with occasional work outside normal office hours. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 15, 2026, or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 15, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537464 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Nov 15, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537464 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Nov 15, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
