    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537465/manager-assistant-manager-at-the-rank-of-administrative-assistant-ii-executive-officer": {
      "title": "Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II /Executive Officer)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Engineering 1 Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II /Executive Officer) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537465 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Manager/Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/Executive Officer) in the Department of Mechanical Engineering (Ref.:537465) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree with at least 8 years of relevant work experience, including a minimum of 5 years in a supervisory or management role, preferably in research administration, grant management, or knowledge transfer. A PhD in Mechanical Engineering or a related discipline will be an advantage. Candidates should demonstrate an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua and Cantonese). They should possess strong communication, organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills, as well as a high level of IT proficiency and the ability to work independently. The successful candidate should demonstrate maturity, professionalism, a strong sense of responsibility, and the ability to manage complex, multi-tasking workflows under tight deadlines. Strong leadership capabilities, teamwork, and a proactive, fast-learning approach to work are essential. Applicants with less experience may be considered for appointment as Assistant Manager. The appointee will provide high-level executive support and proactive coordination in departmental research administration, including pre- and post-award grant management, proposal coordination, compliance checks, and assistance to academic and research staff with project management. He/She will actively facilitate knowledge transfer activities, oversee research metrics and reporting, manage departmental research and funding, and oversee Research Postgraduate operations. In addition, the appointee will lead the planning and execution of major departmental forums, academic conferences, symposia, and research events. He/She will also provide secretarial support to research committees, oversee daily office operations to ensure high-quality service delivery, and perform ad hoc tasks as required, with occasional work outside regular office hours. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 15, 2026, or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 15, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537465 Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II /E