    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537561/lecturerassistant-lecturer-in-smart-planning-with-gis-in-the-department-of-urban-planning-and-design": {
      "title": "Lecturer/Assistant Lecturer in Smart Planning with GIS in the Department of Urban Planning and Design",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Teaching Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Architecture 1 Lecturer/Assistant Lecturer in Smart Planning with GIS in the Department of Urban Planning and Design The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537561 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Categories: Teaching Staff Hong Kong Lecturer/Assistant Lecturer in Smart Planning with GIS in the Department of Urban Planning and Design (Ref.: 537561) (to commence from January 2027, or as soon as possible thereafter, on a two-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal) Applicant should possess a strong Master's or doctoral degree in smart planning with GIS in the fields of urban planning, urban design, urban transportation and urban studies, architecture, landscape architecture, or related disciplines, preferably with substantial experience in professional practices.  Dedication to teaching and nurturing future talents is a must, and prior experience in teaching postgraduate and undergraduate courses, especially studio courses in universities is highly preferred.  Applicants who are members, or eligible for membership of professional institutions in related fields would be advantageous. The appointee will substantially contribute to teaching, tutoring and the coordination of postgraduate and undergraduate degree programmes in the department, provide a high level of administrative assistance to Programme Directors, and perform other duties as assigned by the Head of the Department or his/her delegates. A competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits.  The appointment will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary for Lecturer, or up to 10% of basic salary for Assistant Lecturer. The University only accepts online applications for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V., a teaching statement and a portfolio of design projects.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 4, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 4, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537561 Lecturer/Assistant Lecturer in Smart Planning with GIS in the Department of Urban Planning and Design Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Nov 4, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537561 Lecturer/Assistant Lecturer in Smart Planning with GIS in the Department of Urban Planning and Design Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Nov 4, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
