    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537542/laboratory-technician-at-the-rank-of-research-assistant-ii": {
      "title": "Laboratory Technician (at the rank of Research Assistant II)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Laboratory Technician (at the rank of Research Assistant II) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537542 Work type: Full-time Department: Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Laboratory Technician (at the rank of Research Assistant II) in the Clinical Trials Centre (Ref.: 537542) The Clinical Trials Centre (HKU-CTC) is a leading clinical trials management platform established under The University of Hong Kong LKS Faculty of Medicine (HKUMed) and is dedicated to managing and facilitating international-standard clinical trials on new drugs, medical devices and medical technologies.  HKU-CTC offers long-term development opportunities to passionate talents who are devoted to a career in the clinical trial profession. HKU-CTC’s Biospecimens Core (BioCore) is a core facility for managing and processing biospecimens in clinical trials.  Locating at the Queen Mary Hospital, it is now supporting over 100 clinical trials.  BioCore is seeking talents who have the passion in promoting healthcare advancement through practising the laboratory profession in the clinical research domain. Comprehensive on-the-job training will be provided. Main Responsibilities: Handle and process biospecimens for clinical trials; Undertake pre-trial preparation, including laboratory kits and consumables management; Perform biospecimens processing, storage, packaging and shipping; Manage records and conduct quality control; Communicate with research teams and internal/external collaborators; and Perform other duties as assigned. Work outside normal business days or hours may be required occasionally. Requirements: Associate or Bachelor’s degree in Biological, Medical or Laboratory Sciences or equivalent; Experience in laboratory operations or clinical trial operations and basic knowledge in Good Clinical Practice would be an advantage; Good laboratory skills and commitment to quality and compliance; Detail-minded, able to multi-task, and have a strong sense of responsibility; and Good command of written and spoken English and Chinese. The appointment will be made on a two-year fixed-term full-time contract, to commence as soon as possible with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance.  A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, together with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme at 10% of basic salary.  Other benefits include annual leave and medical benefits. Application Procedure: The University only accepts online applications for the above post.  Applicants should apply online at the University’s careers site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) and upload an up-to-date CV.  Review of applications will begin from October 17, 2026 and continue until November 2, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 3, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 2, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537542 Laboratory Technician (at the rank of Research Assistant II) Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Nov 2, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537542 Laboratory Technician (at the rank of Research Assistant II) Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Nov 2, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
