      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Clerical Assistant The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537501 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Nursing (20800) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Clerical Assistant in the School of Nursing (Ref.: 537501) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should have completed Form 5 or above.  They should have a fair command of English and Chinese, knowledge of MS Office applications, good telephone manners, as well as good communication and interpersonal skills.  The appointee is expected to provide general clerical support to the administrative office of the School, including attending counter and telephone enquiries, performing data entry, preparing meeting documents, copying and filing, etc.  He/She may be required to work outside normal office hours and on weekends.  Relevant work experience would be an advantage.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start on October 15, 2026 and continue until November 26, 2026 or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 1, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 26, 20