    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537548/research-assistant-iii-in-the-department-of-pharmacology-and-pharmacy": {
      "title": "Research Assistant I/II in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Research Assistant I/II in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537548 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (21300) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Research Assistant I/II (2 posts) in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (Ref.: 537548) We now invite applications for the captioned posts. Duties and Responsibilities conduct literature reviews and evidence synthesis assist in healthcare database management, data cleaning and preparation support statistical analyses using large electronic health record databases prepare reports, manuscripts and conference materials coordinate research activities and perform other duties as assigned Requirements a Bachelor's degree or above in pharmacy, epidemiology, public health, statistics, biostatistics, data science, Chinese medicine, biomedical sciences, medicine, or related disciplines a strong sense of responsibility good organizational skills an excellent command of written and spoken English attentive to details independent research skills and capability experience in statistical software (e.g. R, Stata, SAS, Python or SPSS), healthcare database research, systematic reviews, manuscript preparation or project coordination is preferred, but not essential What We Offer The appointments will commence as soon as possible on a 1-year temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered. Other benefits include annual leave, medical benefits and free access to on-campus gyms and libraries. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above posts. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 30, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Oct 1, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537548 Research Assistant I/II in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (21300) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537548 Research Assistant I/II in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (21300) Nov 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
