    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537500/parttime-research-assistant": {
      "title": "Part-time Research Assistant",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Fractional / Part-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Part-time Research Assistant The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537500 Work type: Fractional / Part-time Department: HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow, Research Staff Hong Kong Part-time Research Assistant in the HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (Ref. 537500) We are searching for talented computer programmers to serve as part-time research assistants (RAs). The RAs will help us to improve an existing Python code base for creating 3D models of ancient artifacts from large datasets of 2D images.  The main qualifications are prior experience working on large coding projects and an ability to independently complete tasks efficiently. An interest in computer graphics and vision is also helpful. This project works on scans of archaeological artifacts, ancient objects used by past humans, so an interest in the past is also helpful.  These positions are open to anyone, both students at any level or those who have already graduated. The University only accepts online application for the above posts. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date CV and a cover letter. Review of applications commences as soon as applications are received and continues until the positions are filled. Should you need further information about the post, please contact Prof. Peter Cobb at pcobb@hku.hk . Advertised: Sep 30, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537500 Part-time Research Assistant HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537500 Part-time Research Assistant HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
