    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537536/accounting-executive": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Accounting Executive The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537536 Work type: Full-time Department: Finance and Enterprises Office (60500) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Accounting Executive, Faculty Partnership & Solutions Team in the Finance and Enterprises Office (Ref.: 537536) The Role The appointee will assist in the following areas: handling various finance functions for Faculties and Departments; general accounting duties such as budgetary control, payments and receipts processing, and journal entries preparation and posting; preparing statement of account for funding bodies; some data entry and clerical work; and any other accounting duties as required. Qualifications and Qualities minimum Level 2 in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language, Chinese Language and Mathematics, OR 5 passes in HKCEE including English (minimum Grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007), Chinese (Level 2 from 2007) and Mathematics; at least 1 year’s work experience, preferably in accounting, auditing, and/or banking; a good command of both spoken and written English and Chinese (including Putonghua); good knowledge of PC and software applications such as MS Word, Excel and PowerPoint; experience with Oracle Financials is a plus; self-motivated and good team player, with the ability to work independently; student member of a professional accounting body has an advantage; and fresh university graduates will also be considered. What We Offer The appointment will be made on fixed-term full-time contract for 2 years, to commence as soon as possible with the possibility of renewal. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, together with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme at 10% of basic salary. Other benefits include annual leave and medical benefits. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 29, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 30, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537536 Accounting Executive Finance and Enterprises Office (60500) Oct 29, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537536 Accounting Executive Finance and Enterprises Office (60500) Oct 29, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
