      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Dentistry 1 Research Assistant I/II in the Division of Applied Oral Sciences & Community Dental Care The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537513 Work type: Full-time Department: Applied Oral Sciences and Community Dental Care of the Faculty of Dentistry (08023) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Research Assistant I/II in the Division of Applied Oral Sciences & Community Dental Care (Ref.: 537513) Applications are invited for appointment as Research Assistant I/II in in the Division of Applied Oral Sciences & Community Dental Care of the Faculty of Dentistry , to commence as soon as possible on a one-year temporary contract, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding avaliability. Applicants should hold a bachelor's degree or above, preferably in AI, machine learning, Computer Science, or related disciplines. Candidates should possess strong interpersonal and organizational skills, as well as proficiency in both written and spoken English and Chinese. An interest in collaborating closely with biologists and the ability to work independently with high motivation are also important. Candidates with experience in antibacterial work are preferred and those who are interested in pursuing postgraduate studies are encouraged to apply. The appointee will conduct research on antimicrobial peptides AI model, with training data acquirement, generator training, filter training, etc, and animal and may be antibacterial experiments in a biosafety level 2 laboratory under the supervision of Professor Peng Gao. For enquiries regarding the position, please contact Professor Peng Gao at gaopeng@hku.hk . A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above posts.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until December 28, 2026 or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 29, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 28, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537513 Research Assistant I/II in the Division of Applied Oral Sciences & Community Dental Care Applied Oral Sciences and Community Dental Care of the Faculty of Dentistry (08023) Dec 28, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537513 Research Assistant I/II in the Division of Applied Oral Sciences & Community Dental Care Applied Oral Sciences and Community Dental Care of the Faculty of Dentistry (08023) Dec 28, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
