    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537397/香港大學嘉道理中心聘請-設施服務員": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories General Support Staff 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 香港大學嘉道理中心聘請: 設施服務員 The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537397 Work type: Full-time Department: HKU Kadoorie Centre (53000) Categories: General Support Staff Hong Kong 香港大學嘉道理中心聘請 : 設施服務員 (檔案編號： 537397 ) (須盡早到任；以一年臨時合約形式聘用；若工作表現滿意，可獲續約機會) 受聘者主要負責中心室內及戶外各項設施的清潔整理，包括客房、宿舍、廁所及浴室、辦公室、會議室、實驗室、馬路、溝渠及設置會議場地等一般雜務，並於有需要時協助其他組員及按照上級指派完成其他工作，以維持中心運作暢順。每週工作不少於四十四小時及需彈性輪班工作，並於週末、假日及惡劣天氣期間當值。上班地點為 新界元朗石崗林錦路香港大學嘉道理中心 。 應徵者須具備中三或以上程度，能操流利粵語及略懂普通話、富責任感、工作勤奮、有團隊精神及良好溝通技巧。 入職薪酬將按受聘者之學歷及有關工作經驗釐定。僱員福利包括有薪假期及醫療福利。 應徵者請填妥申請表格，連同個人履歷及有關資料電郵至李小姐 mlwlee@hku.hk 或傳真至 2488 5285 或郵寄至新界元朗石崗林錦路香港大學嘉道理中心行政樓，信封面請註明「機密」及此空缺的「檔案編號」。申請表格（支援員工職位申請表）可從網址 www.hku.hk/apptunit/c-jform.doc 下載。如有查詢，請致電2488 5000與中心職員聯絡。甄選程序將盡快開始至 2026 年 10 月 24 日 ，或直至空缺填滿，以較早者為準。 香港大學感謝應徵者的申請，唯只有獲甄選面試的應徵者會獲通知其申請結果。 Advertised: Sep 23, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 23, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537397 香港大學嘉道理中心聘請: 設施服務員 HKU Kadoorie Centre (53000) Oct 23, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537397 香港大學嘉道理中心聘請: 設施服務員 HKU Kadoorie Centre (53000) Oct 23, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
    },
    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537406/senior-research-assistant": {
      "title": "Senior Research Assistant",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Senior Research Assistant The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537406 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Senior Research Assistant of the Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.:537406) We now invite applications for the captioned post. Duties and Responsibilities Perform clinical studies and be heavily involved in liaison with various parties related to clinical trials Coordinate projects, manage and analyse data Perform administrative tasks and other duties as assigned Requirements Bachelor’s degree with at least 3 years’ post-qualification experience Strong sense of responsibility Good organizational skills and communication skills Ability to multi-task and work independently as well as in a team What We Offer The appointment will commence as soon as possible on a 2-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered. The appointment on fixed terms will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme at 10% of basic salary. Other benefits include annual leave, medical benefits and free access to on-campus gyms and libraries. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start from October 7, 2026 and continue until October 23, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 23, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 23, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537406 Senior Research Assistant Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Oct 23, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537406 Senior Research Assistant Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Oct 23, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
