    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537447/administrative-assistant-i": {
      "title": "Administrative Assistant I",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professional & Management 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Administrative Assistant I The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537447 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Professional & Management Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Administrative Assistant I in the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537447) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability) Applicants should possess a good university degree, preferably a Master’s degree with at least 8 years’ team leadership experience in the higher education sector or a public/quasi-public organization. They should be competent communicators with an excellent command of English and Chinese; be self-motivated with strong strategic awareness and able to work proficiently with significant independence; and possess a high level of decision-making, organizational, time-management and problem-solving skills. Demonstrated ability to plan and implement projects of high strategic value is also required. The appointee will play a versatile role in leading junior executive and clerical staff to support the administration in one or more of the following areas including HR, talent acquisition, organizational development, partnership & engagement, financial budgeting, research administration, committee support, education programme management, student wellness and engagement, PR, IT, facility management, clinical affairs and special projects. The appointment will be made under the Faculty, and the appointee may be posted to school/department/faculty office in a rotational manner. Work outside office hours and on weekends may be required occasionally. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview and/or written test. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 537176) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The appointment will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 22, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 23, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 22, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537447 Administrative Assistant I Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 22, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537447 Administrative Assistant I Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 22, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
