ld apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from October 5, 2026 and continue until October 21, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 22, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 21, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537398 Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) (several posts) Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, School of Clinical Medicine (20900) Oct 21, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537398 Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) (several posts) Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, School of Clinical Medicine (20900) Oct 21, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
