 benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to date C.V. Review of applications will commence on October 5, 2026 and continue until October 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 22, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537428 Laboratory Assistant Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537428 Laboratory Assistant Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
