    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537394/實驗室助理": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 實驗室助理 The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537394 Work type: Full-time Department: Centre for Comparative Medicine Research (21800) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong 比較醫學研究中心聘請：實驗室助理 (檔案編號：537394) (以一年臨時合約形式聘用；若工作表現滿意，可獲續約) 比較醫學研究中心為香港大學李嘉誠醫學院轄下一個致力提高動物福利及提供優質動物以促進科研發展之部門。本中心主力負責繁殖、飼養及照顧實驗動物。 職責： 負責繁殖、飼養及照顧實驗動物 清潔動物房間 搬運和清洗籠具及有關雜務 工作時間: 星期一至五 8:45 – 17:00, 星期六 8:45 – 12:15 (長短週) 資歷 : 中五程度或以上 良好粵語及簡單英語 正面積極、良好態度、溝通及應對技巧 有責任心、有耐性、處事認真、細心 福利 : 有薪假期及公眾假期 醫療及牙科福利 入職薪酬將按受聘者之學歷及相關工作經驗釐定。本中心會為受聘者提供在職培訓。 應徵者可透過網上系統遞交申請 (網址: https://jobs.hku.hk ) 及上載最新的個人履歷或填妥申請表格連同個人履歷郵寄至比較醫學研究中心-香港薄扶林沙宣道10號地下收。申請表格可從網址 www.hku.hk/apptunit/c-jform.doc 下載。如有查詢，請致電39103419。遴選程序將於2026年10月5日開始，直至 2026 年10 月19 日 ，或直至空缺填滿，以較早者為準。 港大徵聘 公開公平 Advertised: Sep 21, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 19, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537394 實驗室助理 Centre for Comparative Medicine Research (21800) Oct 19, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537394 實驗室助理 Centre for Comparative Medicine Research (21800) Oct 19, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
