      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) in Cardiovascular Research The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537404 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Nurse (holding the functional title of Research Nurse) in Cardiovascular Research of the Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537404) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis or one-year temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree in Nursing and be registered with the Nursing Council of Hong Kong.  Previous clinical and research experience is highly preferred.  The appointee will assist in the implementation of research protocols and clinical trials for the Department. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The appointment on fixed-term basis will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536949) need not re-apply. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 17, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 18, 2026 (HK Time) Applica