    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537410/senior-executive-assistantexecutive-assistant-at-the-rank-of-clerk-iii": {
      "title": "Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk I/II)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk I/II) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537410 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk I/II) in the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537410) We are looking for a Senior Executive Assistant or an Executive Assistant to join the HR Team of the LKS Faculty of Medicine. The Role The appointee will assist in a wide range of clerical/administrative work in relation to human resources operations, particularly in the areas of academic staff appointments and tenure/promotion exercises; and perform other duties as assigned. Qualifications and Qualities A recognized Bachelor’s degree; At least 3 years’ solid work experience in office administration, preferably in a tertiary institution; A good command of written and spoken English and Chinese; Strong organizational and interpersonal skills; An appropriate level of IT skills (especially in MS Excel and PowerPoint); and Ability to prioritise workload and produce accurate, detailed work with minimal supervision and under pressure to meet tight deadlines are essential. Those with lower qualifications and/or less experience may be considered for appointment as Executive Assistant. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref: 536673) need not re-apply. What We Offer The appointment will be made on fixed-term full-time contract for 2 years, to commence as soon as possible with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 30, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 18, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537410 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk I/II) Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537410 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk I/II) Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
