    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537304/senior-executive-assistantexecutive-assistant-in-the-faculty-of-science": {
      "title": "Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant in the Faculty of Science",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Science 1 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant in the Faculty of Science The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537304 Work type: Full-time Department: Faculty of Science (25000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant in the Faculty of Science (Ref: 537304) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance). The Role The appointee will be responsible for a mix of administrative and coordination work in undergraduate and/or taught postgraduate programme administration, including: Providing administrative support for undergraduate and/or taught postgraduate curricula matters, including examinations, teaching & learning, course enrolment, timetabling, graduation, experiential learning, student exchange, academic advising, and other student-related matters; Liaising with students, academic staff, and external parties; Performing any other duties as assigned. Qualifications and Qualities A recognized Bachelor’s degree; Preferably a minimum of 3 to 4 years’ work experience for the Senior Executive Assistant position; candidates with less experience may be considered for appointment as Executive Assistant.  Experience in the tertiary education sector is an advantage; Good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua); Strong organizational and interpersonal skills; good IT proficiency; attention to detail; and the ability to multitask and prioritize.  Self-motivated, and able to work independently as well as part of a team; A strong sense of responsibility and professionalism. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536913) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until October 20, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 15, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 20, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537304 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant in the Faculty of Science Faculty of Science (25000) Oct 20, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537304 Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant in the Faculty of Science Faculty of Science (25000) Oct 20, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
