ogramme revamp initiatives, and perform finance-related duties (processing of payment vouchers and purchase orders, and monitoring budgets etc.) for the Department. He/she will also provide comprehensive secretarial and administrative support to academic professoriates, and perform other duties as assigned by supervisors. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written/trade test and an interview. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536899) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 4, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe"
