    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537201/tenuretrack-professorassociate-professorassistant-professor-in-the-department-of-mathematics": {
      "title": "Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Department of Mathematics",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professoriate Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Science 1 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Department of Mathematics The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537201 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Mathematics (25500) Categories: Professoriate Staff Hong Kong Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Department of Mathematics The Department of Mathematics invites applications for multiple tenure-track positions at the ranks of Professor, Associate Professor, and Assistant Professor (Ref.: 537201).  Appointments will initially be made on a three-year fixed-term basis, commencing as soon as possible, with the possibility of renewal and consideration for tenure before the expiry of a second three-year fixed-term contract.  Exceptionally outstanding candidates at the Professor/Associate Professor level may be considered for appointment on tenure terms, subject to approval. The Department of Mathematics is committed to providing rigorous and comprehensive undergraduate education, fostering graduate research among students with strong mathematical aptitude, and advancing teaching and research with the goal of achieving international excellence.  Further information about the Faculty and the Department can be found at https://www.scifac.hku.hk and https://www.math.hku.hk , respectively. Applicants should possess a Ph.D. degree in Mathematics or a related field.  The Department welcomes candidates from all areas of mathematics, with particular interest in those whose research enhances or complements existing strengths.  Appointees will be expected to contribute to undergraduate and postgraduate teaching, supervise graduate students, conduct high-quality research, and participate in administrative duties at both the Departmental and Faculty levels.  Enquiries may be directed to the Head of the Department of Mathematics at ghan@hku.hk . A highly competitive salary, commensurate with qualifications and experience, will be offered, in addition to annual leave, professional leave and medical benefits.  At current rates, salaries tax does not exceed 15% of gross income.  The appointment will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary.  Housing benefits will be provided as applicable.  A start-up package tailored to the appointee’s experience and research needs will be provided. The University only accepts online application for the above posts.  Applicants should apply online and upload a cover letter, an up-to-date curriculum vitae with a detailed publication list, a teaching statement, a research statement, and the contact information of at least four referees (three focusing on research and one on teaching).  Review of applications will start immediately and continue until December 15, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 3, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 15, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537201 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Department of Mathematics Department of Mathematics (25500) Dec 15, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537201 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Department of Mathematics Department of Mathematics (25500) Dec 15, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
