    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537188/parttime-research-nurse-at-the-rank-of-nurse": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Part-time Research Nurse (at the rank of Nurse) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537188 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Clinical Oncology, School of Clinical Medicine (21600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Part-time Research Nurse (at the rank of Nurse) in the Department of Clinical Oncology, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537188) (to commence as soon as possible on one-year temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree in Nursing or higher and be registered with the Nursing Council of Hong Kong. Experience and/or interest in clinical research and project coordination, as well as experience in blood-taking, is preferred. They should also demonstrate excellent written and spoken English and Chinese; a strong sense of responsibility and accountability; good organizational, interpersonal and communication skills; and be detail-minded. The appointee will coordinate and support clinical trials, including but not limited to project management, data analysis and administrative tasks.  He/She will assist in subject recruitment; provision of nursing care (e.g. blood-taking and drug administration); database management; and perform other duties as assigned. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits, if applicable. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online at the University’s careers site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) and upload an up-to-date CV. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until December 2, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 3, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 2, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537188 Part-time Research Nurse (at the rank of Nurse) Department of Clinical Oncology, School of Clinical Medicine (21600) Dec 2, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537188 Part-time Research Nurse (at the rank of Nurse) Department of Clinical Oncology, School of Clinical Medicine (21600) Dec 2, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
