      "title": "Administrative Assistant I / II",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Administrative Assistant I / II The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537129 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Administrative Assistant I / II in the School of Biomedical Sciences (Ref.: 537129) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year  fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of the basic salary for Administrative Assistant I, or 10% of the basic salary for Administrative Assistant II, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good university degree with at least 8–10 years of relevant hands-on experience at a supervisory level in the tertiary education sector. An excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese, coupled with high-level communication, interpersonal, and organisational skills, is essential. Applicants should be self-motivated, attentive to detail, and capable of multi-tasking and working independently under pressure to meet tight deadlines. A strong sense of responsibility, problem-solving ability, and proven leadership skills to motivate and lead a team are also required. The appointee will lead the Teaching and Learning team and provide a full spectrum of administrative support to the School. Key responsibilities include playing a versatile role in the planning, execution, and development of undergraduate programmes and student activities; overseeing programme administration, including the maintenance of student records and information systems, assessments, and committee work; supervising executive and clerical staff; and performing ad hoc and non-routine tasks as assigned. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. Applicants with less experience and/or lower qualifications may be considered for the position of Administrative Assistant II. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start from September 9, 2026 and continue until October 26, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Aug 27, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 26, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537129 Administrative Assistant I / II School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Oct 26, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537129 Administrative Assistant I / II School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Oct 26, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
