    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537131/clerk-ii-holding-the-functional-title-of-executive-assistant": {
      "title": "Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537131 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) in the School of Biomedical Sciences (Ref.: 537131) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should have 5 passes in HKCEE including English (min. Grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007), Chinese (Level 2 from 2007) and Mathematics; OR min. Level 2 or equivalent in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language, Chinese Language and Mathematics, preferably with a recognized degree plus at least 2 years’ work experience. They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese; good communication, organizational and problem-solving skills; as well as an appropriate level of IT skills. They should also be good team player with self-motivation and a strong sense of responsibility. Degree holders will be offered the functional title of Executive Assistant. The appointee will provide support in education programme administration, organize a variety of academic activities and events, and perform ad hoc and non-routine tasks as required. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start from September 9, 2026 and continue until October 26, 2026 or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Aug 27, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 26, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537131 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Oct 26, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537131 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Oct 26, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
