d medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Application should apply online and upload a covering letter and an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and deadline of application is Novem ber 30, 2026, or until the post is filled. Advertised: Aug 19, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537098 Clerical Assistant in Morrison Hall Morrison Hall (56500) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537098 Clerical Assistant in Morrison Hall Morrison Hall (56500) Nov 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
