    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/536793/tenuretrack-clinical-associate-professor-clinical-assistant-professor-several-posts": {
      "title": "Tenure-Track Clinical Associate Professor / Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professoriate Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Tenure-Track Clinical Associate Professor / Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 536793 Work type: Full-time Department: Centre of Cancer Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (22900) Categories: Professoriate Staff Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointments as Tenure-Track Clinical Associate Professor/ Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts) in the Centre of Cancer Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 536793), to commence as soon as possible, on a four-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and consideration for tenure before the expiry of a second four-year fixed-term contract. The Centre of Cancer Medicine is a platform to facilitate the academic development of cancer medicine and oncology, and is created to foster collaboration among the cognate disciplines/ (sub)specialities within the Centre of Cancer Medicine/ School of Clinical Medicine, and with other Schools/ Departments/ Institutes/ Hospitals/ Colleges. Applicants should possess a medical qualification registrable with the Medical Council of Hong Kong, with a specialist qualification in Clinical Oncology/Medical Oncology recognized by the Hong Kong Academy of Medicine or its equivalent. They should demonstrate a strong commitment to clinical service, research and teaching, and will be expected to help further strengthen the Centre’s teaching in Cancer Medicine across the broad spectrum of medical and health sciences education. Applicants should have a proven record of independent research and are expected to actively engage in collaborative projects within the University and beyond, working across related disciplines and subspecialties in alignment with the Centre’s core theme of promoting cross-disciplinary synergy in cancer research and education. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. At current rates, salaries tax does not exceed 15% of gross income. The appointments will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits schemes, totalling up to 15% of basic salary. A monthly cash allowance will be offered to the successful candidates. Housing benefits will also be provided as applicable. The University only accepts online application at the University’s career site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) for the above posts. Applicants should apply online, upload an up-to-date C.V. and provide contact information of at least 3 referees. Review of applications will start from September 20, 2026 and continue until January 20, 2027 or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Jul 21, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Jan 20, 2027 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536793 Tenure-Track Clinical Associate Professor / Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts) Centre of Cancer Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (22900) Jan 20, 2027 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536793 Tenure-Track Clinical Associate Professor / Clinical Assistant Professor (several posts) Centre of Cancer Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (22900) Jan 20, 2027 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
