    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/536608/senior-research-assistant-research-assistant-iii-student-research-assistant-in-ai-agents-for-architecture-and-construction": {
      "title": "Senior Research Assistant /Research Assistant I/II /Student Research Assistant in AI Agents for Architecture and Construction",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Fractional / Part-time 1 Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Architecture 1 Senior Research Assistant /Research Assistant I/II /Student Research Assistant in AI Agents for Architecture and Construction The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 536608 Work type: Fractional / Part-time, Full-time Department: Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong The Department of Urban Planning and Design invites applications for Senior Research Assistant / Research Assistant I/II / Student Research Assistant in AI Agents for Architecture and Construction (Ref. no.: 536608).  Appointments will commence as soon as possible for 6 to 12 months, full-time or part-time, with the possibility of renewal based on performance and funding availability. Responsibilities Conduct cutting-edge research and develop practical AI agents and skills that enhance workflows in architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC) Requirements Applicant should be undergraduate student of any discipline for Student Research Assistant position; or have a Bachelor’s degree or above of any discipline for Research Assistant I/II and Senior Research Assistant position. AI-native; Highly fluent with tools like Codex or Claude Code (or equivalents), and can leverage them to learn and solve new and complex problems rapidly; Strong judgment, and can quickly evaluate what works, what doesn’t, and why; and If you can think, prototype, and build effectively with AI, we want to hear from you. How to Apply Applications are accepted exclusively online.  Applicants should submit their application via the University’s Careers site, including an up-to-date curriculum vitae (C.V.).  Review of applications will begin immediately and continue until January 31, 2027 , or until the positions are filled, whichever comes first. In addition to applying online, you can supplement by emailing your CV to junma@hku.hk.  In your material, demonstrate your AI-native capability in any way you think is effective (e.g., a short portfolio of AI-built projects, a small prototype, GitHub repo, etc.).  We value signal over formality. Advertised: Jul 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Jan 31, 2027 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536608 Senior Research Assistant /Research Assistant I/II /Student Research Assistant in AI Agents for Architecture and Construction Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Jan 31, 2027 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536608 Senior Research Assistant /Research Assistant I/II /Student Research Assistant in AI Agents for Architecture and Construction Department of Urban Planning and Design (01300) Jan 31, 2027 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
