    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/536701/tenuretrack-professorassociate-professorassistant-professor-in-the-faculty-of-law": {
      "title": "Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Law",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professoriate Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Law 1 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Law The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 536701 Work type: Full-time Department: Faculty of Law (18100) Categories: Professoriate Staff Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Law (Ref.: 536701), to commence on September 1, 2027, or as soon as possible thereafter, on a three-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal and with consideration for tenure before the expiry of the second three-year fixed-term contract. Suitably qualified applicants may be considered for direct tenure. The Faculty of Law is the longest established law school in Hong Kong. It plays a leading role in legal education in Hong Kong and Asia. The Faculty welcomes applications from outstanding candidates in all areas of legal scholarship, and particularly those who specialize in the following areas: criminal law, contract law, corporate and commercial law, public law, tort law and international law. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, together with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme at 15% of basic salary. Other benefits include annual leave, professional leave and medical benefits. Housing benefits will be provided as applicable. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V., with details of relevant experience and course teaching interests. The University thanks applicants for their interest, but advises that only candidates shortlisted for interviews will be notified of the application result. Closes December 31, 2026 . Advertised: Jul 6, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536701 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Law Faculty of Law (18100) Dec 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 536701 Tenure-Track Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Law Faculty of Law (18100) Dec 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
