    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537680/postdoctoral-fellow-several-posts": {
      "title": "Post-doctoral Fellow (several posts)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Post-doctoral Fellow (several posts) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537680 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Post-doctoral Fellow (several posts) in the School of Chinese Medicine (Ref.:537680), to commence as soon as possible for a period of one year with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance. Applicants should possess a Ph.D. degree in Chinese Medicine or related disciplines, with proven research experience in experimental and clinical studies.  Those with an outstanding track record of high-quality publications in basic research, clinical and translational research are preferred.   He or she should be meticulous, self-motivated, and be able to work in collaboration across teams.  Proficiency with excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese is required. The appointees are expected to be involved in research projects pertaining to various disciplines of Chinese Medicine for the treatment of cancers, metabolic disorders, aging-related diseases, mental disorders and autoimmune diseases as well as quality control of Chinese herbal medicine.  He/she will perform related research analysis, conduct clinical study, write reports and papers, assist in supervising postgraduate students and carry out other duties as assigned.  Enquiries about the duties of the post can be sent to scmhr@hku.hk . Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref:536903) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 30, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University thanks applicants for their interest, but advises that only candidates shortlisted for interviews will be notified of the application results. Advertised: Oct 16, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537680 Post-doctoral Fellow (several posts) School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537680 Post-doctoral Fellow (several posts) School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Nov 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
    },
    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537595/senior-manager-at-the-rank-of-administrative-assistant-i": {
      "title": "Senior Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant I)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Professional & Management 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Senior Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant I) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537595 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Clinical Medicine (23000) Categories: Professional & Management Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Senior Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant I) in the School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537595) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability) Applicants should possess a good university degree, preferably a Master’s degree, with at least 10 years’ work experience at supervisory level in the higher education sector or a related field.  They should be excellent communicators with an exceptional command of English and Chinese; possess a strong sense of responsibility and strategic awareness; be capable of working proficiently with significant independence; and be able to keep their subordinates motivated to deliver quality work under tight deadlines.  They are also expected to possess a high level of decision-making, organisational, time-management and problem-solving skills, as well as an appropriate level of IT knowledge.  Experience in undergraduate programme management and/or assessment-related duties in professional programmes would be an advantage. The appointee will play a versatile role in leading junior administrative, executive and clerical staff in supporting a range of tasks, primarily in the assessment of undergraduate students pursuing a professional degree programme.  He/she will be responsible for developing assessment policies and procedures with reference to the latest curricular reforms, overseeing the preparation for and conducting of examinations in various formats, as well as the release of results and associated follow-up tasks.  Other duties may include implementing new teaching and learning initiatives for enhancing the all-round development of our students.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview and/or a written test. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref: 537082) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits.  The appointment will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 12, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 16, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 12, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537595 Senior Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant I) School of Clinical Medicine (23000) Nov 12, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537595 Senior Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant I) School of Clinical Medicine (23000) Nov 12, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 