      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Programme Manager The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537671 Work type: Full-time Department: Admissions Office of the Registry (60381) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Programme Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) in the Admissions Office of the Registry (Ref.: 537671) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, and with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should have a good Bachelor's degree with at least 3 years' work experience, preferably in the education sector or public relations-related fields.  They should have an excellent command of spoken and written English and Chinese; a high level of proficiency in Microsoft Excel, including the use of PivotTable, and formulas.  They are also expected to be good team players, possess strong organisational and logical thinking skills, be self-motivated, and be able to work independently with initiative while handling multiple tasks.  Experience in database management and programming is preferred. The appointee is expected to work with the team in collecting, consolidating, managing and analysing data, as well as conducting business analysis to facilitate strategic planning for the University’s admissions.  He/She is also expected to assist with undergraduate admissions operations, such as processing applications, coordinating interviews, liaising with faculties and units, and performing any other duties assigned by the supervisor.  The appointee may be required to work outside normal office hours and on weekends.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 8, 2026, or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 16, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 8, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537671 Programme Manager Admissions Office of the Registry (60381) Nov 8, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537671 Programme Manager Admissions Office of the Registry (60381) Nov 8, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
