ointments and related Human Resources matters; provide general administrative and clerical support to The Faculty’s Knowledge Exchange unit, including databases maintenance, finance and event records, other administrative documentation and general office filing; support Knowledge Exchange unit’s initiatives, including seminars, workshops, forums, and other engagement events, ensuring alignment with Knowledge Exchange’s objectives; and perform other duties as assigned by the Manager and the Director, Knowledge Exchange. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online at the University’s careers site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 4, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Oct 15, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 4, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537647 Senior Executive Assistant, Knowledge Exchange (at the rank of Clerk I) Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Nov 4, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537647 Senior Executive Assistant, Knowledge Exchange (at the rank of Clerk I) Fac