      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Research Assistant I The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537670 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, School of Clinical Medicine (20900) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Research Assistant I in the Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537670) (to commence as soon as possible for one year, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree, preferably in Biology, Biomedical Science, or Health Science. They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Cantonese), excellent communication and interpersonal skills. They should be organized, self-motivated, and able to work independently as well as part of a team. The appointee will participate in research projects relating to sperm fertility, fertilization, and clinical in vitro fertilization, and perform any other duties as assigned by the supervisor. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 537264) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from October 31, 2026 and continue until November 9, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 15, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 9, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp