    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537564/clerk-ii-holding-the-functional-title-of-executive-assistant": {
      "title": "Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537564 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) in the Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (Ref.: 537564) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis or one-year temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a Higher Diploma or an Associate Degree or an equivalent qualification.  Fresh graduates are welcome to apply. Applicants should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua); strong organisational, interpersonal and communication skills; proficiency in computer applications; and the ability to work independently as well as collaboratively.  They should also be self-motivated, attentive to details, and able to multitask.  Immediate availability will be an advantage. The appointee will provide clerical support to the Department, including assisting in daily office operations; handling general enquiries and correspondence; supporting recruitment and HR-related administration; processing procurement-related documentation; maintaining records and databases; assisting in office and facilities administration; and performing other duties as assigned. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits.  The appointment on fixed-term basis will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of the basic salary. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from October 27, 2026 and continue until November 10, 202 6 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 14, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 10, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537564 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Nov 10, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537564 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) Department of Ophthalmology, School of Clinical Medicine (22300) Nov 10, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
