    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537583/fulltime-research-assistant-i-in-the-faculty-of-education": {
      "title": "Full-time Research Assistant I in the Faculty of Education",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Faculty of Education 1 Full-time Research Assistant I in the Faculty of Education The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537583 Work type: Full-time Department: Faculty of Education (10000) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Full-time Research Assistant I in the Faculty of Education (Ref.:537583) Applications are invited for the captioned post. The successful candidate will be involved in a specific research project related to hearing health management. Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree in any discipline. They should have a good command of written and spoken English, speak Cantonese proficiently and are capable in one or more of the following areas: (1) experience in software engineering in Python; (2) doing literature review; (3) proofreading articles in English; (4) processing statistics (especially SPSS); and (5) conducting data analysis (e.g., NVivo & SPSS). The appointee will search for relevant materials for the project, conduct interviews, collect and analyze data, conduct transcriptions, and perform other duties as assigned.  Experience is an advantage but not required. The appointment will commence on 1 November 2026 or as soon as possible for one year, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date CV. Applications will be reviewed as soon as possible and continue until 20 November 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Oct 14, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 20, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537583 Full-time Research Assistant I in the Faculty of Education Faculty of Education (10000) Nov 20, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537583 Full-time Research Assistant I in the Faculty of Education Faculty of Education (10000) Nov 20, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
