    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537612/executive-officer-clerk-i": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Executive Officer/ Clerk I The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537612 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Officer/ Clerk I in the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537612) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good Bachelor’s degree, with at least 3 years’ solid administrative work experience, preferably in a tertiary institution. They should have a good command of written and spoken English (with an overall band score of 7.5 or above in IELTS; or equivalent) and Chinese; strong communications, organizational and problem-solving skills; as well as an appropriate level of IT skills. They are also expected to have the ability to prioritize multiple tasks efficiently to meet strict deadlines with minimal supervision; and a good sense of tact in dealing with sensitive and confidential issues, including discreet handling of personnel and confidential files. The appointee will provide organizational and administrative support to senior administrators of the Faculty Office/Deanery/Schools/Departments in the relevant areas and/or on rotational basis, to assist with special initiatives and/or projects, and to perform ad-hoc tasks as assigned. Those with lower qualifications and/or less experience may be considered for appointment as Clerk I. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref: 536938) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 11, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 13, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 11, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537612 Executive Officer/ Clerk I Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Nov 11, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537612 Executive Officer/ Clerk I Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Nov 11, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
