lier. Advertised: Oct 26, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 25, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537705 Part-time Senior Technical Officer in the Division of Gastroenterology and Hepatology Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Nov 25, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537705 Part-time Senior Technical Officer in the Division of Gastroenterology and Hepatology Department of Medicine, School of Clinical Medicine (20600) Nov 25, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
