e above posts.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from November 9, 2026 and continue until December 21, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 26, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 21, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537711 Senior Clerk School of Nursing (20800) Dec 21, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537711 Senior Clerk School of Nursing (20800) Dec 21, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
