    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537656/clerk-iii-holding-the-functional-title-of-senior-executive-assistantexecutive-assistant": {
      "title": "Clerk I/II (holding the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Clerk I/II (holding the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537656 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Clerk I/II (holding the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant) (several posts) in the School of Biomedical Sciences (Ref.: 537656) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal). Applicants should hold a Bachelor’s degree with at least three years’ relevant work experience. They must demonstrate strong written and spoken English and Chinese skills, excellent communication, organisational and problem-solving abilities, solid IT proficiency, self-motivation, a strong sense of responsibility, and the capacity to thrive as a team player. Candidates with less experience may be considered for appointment at Clerk II level, while degree holders will receive the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant. The appointee will provide administrative support in one of the following areas: Human Resources: Handling personnel matters and appointments. Finance: Processing payments, purchase orders, invoices and reimbursements. Knowledge Exchange and Global: Managing the School’s social media platforms; organising marketing campaigns and events. Research and Innovation: Processing research grant applications and postgraduate admissions; organising symposia, seminars and visiting professor engagements. Teaching and Learning: Coordinating course and examination timetables; organising academic activities and events; plus ad hoc and non-routine tasks as required. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until January 22, 2027 or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 23, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Jan 22, 2027 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537656 Clerk I/II (holding the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Jan 22, 2027 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537656 Clerk I/II (holding the functional title of Senior Executive Assistant/Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Jan 22, 2027 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
