    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537655/全職兼職中醫助理配藥員": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Fractional / Part-time 1 Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 全職/兼職中醫助理配藥員 The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537655 Work type: Fractional / Part-time, Full-time Department: School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong 中醫藥學院聘請：全職 / 兼職中醫助理配藥員 (檔案編號：537655) (以一年合約形式聘用，若工作表現滿意，可獲續約) 應徵者須持有： (一）香港大學認可的中藥學學士學位，及具有至少一年於香港從事中醫配藥的工作經驗；或 (二）香港中醫藥管理委員會認可院校所頒發的中藥配劑文憑，及具有至少三年於香港從事中醫配藥的工作經驗。 此外，應徵者須熟悉中醫藥理論，並具備中藥材加工、炮製及倉儲保管的工作經驗。學歷較低或工作經驗較淺者，可獲考慮受聘為中藥房服務員。 受聘者主要負責煎藥、配藥、中藥配劑，及協助處理中藥材加工、炮製等工作，並協助藥房的日常運作。 應徵者若曾申請此職位(檔案編號：533858)，則毋須再次申請。 入職薪酬將按受聘者的學歷及有關工作經驗釐定，僱員福利包括有薪假期及醫療福利。 大學只接受透過網上系統遞交的申請。應徵者請到大學人才招聘網站遞交網上申請及上載最新的個人履歷。截止申請日期為 2026 年 11 月 30 日 。大學感謝應徵者的申請，唯只有獲甄選參加面試的應徵者才會收到通知。 港大徵聘 公開公平 Advertised: Oct 22, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537655 全職/兼職中醫助理配藥員 School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537655 全職/兼職中醫助理配藥員 School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Nov 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
