    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537628/executive-assistant-at-the-rank-of-clerk-ii": {
      "title": "Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537628 Work type: Full-time Department: HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) (2 posts) in the HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (Ref.: 537628) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good Bachelor’s degree, preferably in communication, marketing, or media-related disciplines, with at least 2 years of full-time work experience, preferably in tertiary education. They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese, and proficiency in Microsoft Office and Adobe applications. They should also demonstrate a willingness to learn, good interpersonal skills, self-motivation, attention to detail, and a strong sense of responsibility. Experience in managing RPg and/or non-credit-bearing programmes, providing event support, and video editing is required. The appointees will provide clerical, administrative, office, and programme support, including receptionist duties, facilities management, and financial assistance. They will also be required to provide logistical and multimedia support for programmes, events and seminars, including venue booking, photography, video shooting and editing. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview. The University only accepts online application for the above posts.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 9, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Oct 20, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 9, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537628 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Nov 9, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537628 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) HKU Musketeers Foundation Institute of Data Science (47000) Nov 9, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
