    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537753/實驗室服務員": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories General Support Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 實驗室服務員 The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537753 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Surgery, School of Clinical Medicine (21700) Categories: General Support Staff Hong Kong 香港大學外科學系聘請：實驗室服務員 (檔案編號：537753) (以兩年合約形式聘用，受聘者於合約期滿時可獲約滿酬金及大學按強積金計劃所規定的供款，合共為薪金總和的百分之十；若工作表現滿意，可獲考慮續約。) 應徵者須具備中三或以上程度學歷，能操流利廣東話，並具備簡單英語及普通話溝通能力；能閱讀及書寫簡單中、英文者更佳。應徵者須主動積極、守時盡責、具工作效率，能同時處理多項職務，並具良好服務態度及團隊合作精神。具相關工作經驗者將獲優先考慮。 受聘者須負責為本部門實驗室（包括辦公室及會議室）提供支援服務，主要職責包括： • 執行日常清潔及整理工作，保持實驗室、辦公室、會議室及公共地方整潔； • 清洗、消毒及整理實驗室玻璃器皿、塑膠器皿及其他用具; • 協助高壓蒸氣滅菌、烘乾及實驗物料準備工作； • 送遞及分派信件、文件及其他物品； • 點算、搬運及整理物資、設備及用品； • 按照實驗室安全程序處理日常廢物； • 執行其他獲委派之職務。 入職薪酬將按受聘者之學歷及相關工作經驗釐定。僱員福利包括有薪假期及醫療福利。 大學只接受透過網上系統遞交的申請。應徵者須於大學網站遞交網上申請及上載最新的個人履歷。遴選程序將盡快展開，直至 2026年11月30日 ，或直至空缺填補，以較早者為準。 Advertised: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537753 實驗室服務員 Department of Surgery, School of Clinical Medicine (21700) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Provost and Deputy Vice-Chancellor Vice-President and Pro-Vice-Chancellor (Global) Dean of Business and Economics Chief Information Officer and University Librarian Director of the Development & Alumni Affairs Office HKU Global Professoriate Recruitment 