nline and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 06, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is the earlier. Advertised: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 6, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537684 Executive Assistant Department of Psychology (30200) Nov 6, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537684 Executive Assistant Department of Psychology (30200) Nov 6, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
