    "https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/537754/administrative-assistant-iii": {
      "title": "Administrative Assistant I/II",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Professional & Management 1 Faculty Non-Faculty Units 1 Administrative Assistant I/II The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537754 Work type: Full-time Department: Research Services of the Registry (60340) Categories: Professional & Management, Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Administrative Assistant I/II in Research Services of the Registry (Ref.: 537754) The Role The appointee will provide administrative and operational support for research-related events, internal and external research grants and awards, committee servicing and other duties as assigned by the Supervisor and Section Head. Qualifications and Qualities Applicants should have a good University degree with at least 10 years’ working experience in the higher education sector, of which at least 5 years should be at the supervisory or management level. They should have extensive knowledge of research administration, including the administration of research grants and awards, committee servicing and the organisation of research-related events. They should also have excellent communication skills, inclusive of good command of written and spoken English and Chinese; IT competency and AI literacy; a strong sense of responsibility; be mature and meticulous, self-motivated, and a good team player with excellent organisational and interpersonal skills; be able to work on their own initiative; and have the ability to work under pressure, meet tight deadlines and set priorities with minimal supervision. What We Offer The appointment will be made on a full-time fixed-term contract for two years, to commence as soon as possible, with the possibility of renewal.  A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 15% of basic salary for Administrative Assistant I, or 10% of basic salary for Administrative Assistant II.  Other benefits include annual leave and medical benefits. Applicants with less experience may be considered for appointment as Administrative Assistant II. How to Apply The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online at the University’s career site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ), and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 12, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview and a written test. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 537199) need not re-apply. Advertised: Oct 29, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 12, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537754 Administrative Assistant I/II Research Services of the Registry (60340) Nov 12, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537754 Administrative Assistant I/II Research Services of the Registry (60340) Nov 12, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
